# Findings this repository cannot act on, with a date by which it must look
# again. Never a permanent suppression: an entry with no expiry is how a report
# stops being read.
#
# The runtime base (aspnet:10.0-noble-chiseled) has no package manager, so a
# finding in its glibc or OpenSSL waits for Microsoft to rebuild the image. The
# 10.0.13 image (built 2026-10-13) cleared the last ones, and none are listed.
